<!-- API endpoint → DB — Mermaid sequence and flow -->

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Router
  participant Controller
  participant Validator
  participant Service
  participant Repo
  participant DB
  participant Queue

  Client->>Router: POST /api/v1/resource {body}
  Router->>Validator: validate DTO
  Validator-->>Router: ok / errors
  alt valid
    Router->>Controller: forward request
    Controller->>Service: createResource(dto)
    Service->>Repo: beginTransaction()
    Service->>Repo: insert(entity)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO resource ...
    DB-->>Repo: OK
    Repo->>Service: commit()
    Service->>Queue: enqueue background notification (optional)
    Service-->>Controller: ResourceCreated(response)
    Controller->>Client: 201 Created + body
  else invalid
    Router->>Client: 400 Bad Request
  end

  alt DB error
    Repo-->>Service: error
    Service->>Repo: rollback()
    Service->>Controller: generate 500 error response
  end
```

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  A[Client] --> B[API Gateway / Router]
  B --> C[Controller]
  C --> D[Service Layer]
  D --> E[Repository / DB Transaction]
  D --> F[Background Queue]
  E --> G[SQL Database]
  F --> H[Worker: process notifications]
```
